Name: COMPASS_2013_I1236358
Year: 2013
Summary: Low-transverse-momentum inverse slopes of charged-hadron SIDIS multiplicities
Experiment: COMPASS
Collider: CERN SPS fixed target
InspireID: 1236358
Status: UNVALIDATED
Reentrant: true
Authors:
