RunInfo: >
  Requires zero-polarization 160 GeV mu+ p and mu+ n samples, with POSNLO
  and NEGNLO generated separately. The runner combines normalized signed-NLO
  target yields and performs the published 0.1 < pT < 0.85 GeV exponential fit.
NumEvents: 100000
NeedsCrossSection: yes
Beams: [[ANTIMUON, PROTON], [ANTIMUON, NEUTRON]]
Energies: [[160.0, 0.938272], [160.0, 0.939565]]
Description: >
  Fills event-aggregated unidentified h+ and h- pT2 spectra in the published
  23 (x,Q2) by 8 z cells. The postprocessor extracts <pT2> from a weighted
  single-exponential fit. This is a generator-level shower, recoil, intrinsic-
  transverse-momentum and hadronization diagnostic; detector acceptance and
  radiative corrections are not simulated.
Keywords: [DIS, SIDIS, fixed-target, multiplicity, charged hadron, transverse momentum]
